{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀～～學園長～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 448, "voice": "go029", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『大家早安♪』", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0044", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "週一的慣例，全校集會。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們各務台來的學生對第二次的集會也習慣了。有些女生還混在結女的學生中發出尖叫。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這就是近朱者赤啊……」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0249", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男生也尖叫一下比較好嗎？」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「集會中禁止私下交談。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0250", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "順帶一提，從這次開始我的隔壁就站著瀨名同學。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為擔任班級幹部，所以我站在各務台學生的排頭，瀨名同學則是站在結女學生隊伍的排頭。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『嗯～這次各務台的學生們好像也熱鬧起來了呢。』", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0045", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽著各務台女生的尖叫聲，台上的學園長非常愉悅地點了點頭。", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『男生們還在害羞嗎？一起大喊也可以喔，喊「學園長～」♪』", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0046", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，那就來喊喊看吧！喊『學園長請責罵我～』這樣！」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0136", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太同學，原來你這麼M！？」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0194", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣喊的話結女的學生也都會罵你，對M男隼太來說很賺吧。」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要以我是M為前提討論啦！不過好像很有趣就算了。」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0137", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我說了嚴禁私下交談！」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0251", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過就算不尖叫，學園長相關的話題也夠我們熱烈討論了。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "男生們……至少我和隼太是多多少少近朱者赤了。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──應該說以這個道理來看，只有瀨名同學一個人保持著她孤高的顏色。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『老實說吧～我個人連體育課也想改成男女混合喔！』", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0047", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但學園長興致勃勃地鼓吹著學生們。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『這樣一來我當然也會參加！會穿體操服喔！我可是還穿得起的呢～』", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0048", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長穿體操服，想看～～！」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 440, "voice": "sa0021", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是自己穿的樣子不想被男生看到～～～～」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 470, "voice": "ja0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『喔，這個反應不錯呢。妳們這群少女現在正閃閃發光喔！啊哈哈哈！』", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "蘭華", "alt_speaker_idx": 477, "voice": "rk0049", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是想看欸，喂。」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0138", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想看……」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 443, "voice": "da0022", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「討厭～男生好色～」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 441, "voice": "sb0023", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也想看……我也色嗎？」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": "jc0021", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園長真的是個天才型炒熱氣氛的高手啊。跟以前學校的全校集會完全不同。", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我不想看。」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0252", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──其中。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我想安穩無事地生活。」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0253", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我聽到瀨名同學小聲地說。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我又來玩了～打擾囉！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0107", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕～」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0051", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊～！！」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0050", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥，吃飯……啊，熊喵、天羽學姊。」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0255", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有種賓客雲集的感覺呢！也就是說，現在是安潔出廠的時候了～」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0195", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是合併試辦開始第二個星期的最後一天，午休時間已經變成這種感覺了。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喲，小櫻乃。妳拿便當來嗎？跟我們一起吃吧！」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0139", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，不用說也會。」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0256", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟小熊喵也可以一起嗎？」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0108", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽學姊、熊喵，妳們好。當然可以了！」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學姊在的話，我也要一起～」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0051", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟隼太、安潔和乾同學、天羽學姊和熊喵，以及櫻乃聚在一起。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家說說笑笑地吃午飯……已經完全想像不出第一天那種尷尬的氣氛了。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……那麼像個女僕般聰明伶俐的安潔，此時就來華麗地為大家準備茶水……」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0196", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0109", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽學姊突然對我的脖子伸出手，讓我心臟猛跳了一下。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「領帶歪了喔……好，這樣就可以了。」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0110", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，非常謝謝妳。」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然而然就注意到這種小地方，真不愧是天羽學姊。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔，怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0257", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊──！從以前就一直在想了，美羽學姊這是什麼天然的女僕力啊！」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0199", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼欸？」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0111", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不能輸……安潔、安潔遇到危機了！身為真正的女僕，此刻！」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0200", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……安潔對天羽學姊燃起對抗意識了？", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「糟糕！安潔又對美羽學姊！」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0052", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又！？」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家快逃！！」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0053", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「現在只能使出非常手段了……！」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0201", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊～！安潔一個不小心把托盤整個翻倒了──！！」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0202", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是故意的吧……」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是不用擔心，因為本人安潔！立刻就使出華麗的整理技巧！」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0203", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「超級自導自演欸！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0140", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的那位同學！請不要對細節進行吐槽！」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0204", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……欸、所以、也就是說。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原來她是個自己製造出讓自己發揮專長的狀況，攻擊性超強的女僕啊。", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「請安心，因為安潔會注意翻得不給大家添麻煩。」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0205", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，真的欸。杯盤都沒有破，上面的東西也沒有散落一地……」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是用莫大的細心達成的自導自演。」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0258", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「常有的事呢，真的。不過很有趣所以算了。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0054", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，很有趣呢～小菜夏。」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0112", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「於是，面對自己的失誤邊流淚邊收拾的安潔，呵呵，沒有比這更經典的女僕了啊……」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0206", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只要像女僕就什麼都無所謂了啊。」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為安潔的女僕表演（？），大家又談笑得更熱鬧了──", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔。」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0254", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學回到教室，一看見我們就露出了不悅的表情。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休開始的時候她就離開了教室。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，小愛理，妳好～不介意的話要不要一起吃午餐呢？」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0113", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不用了，容我拒絕──」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0255", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕、嗚嚕～♪」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0052", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下、不要過來啊！」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0256", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵也想跟小愛理一起喔～」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "mu0114", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一個人就好了。」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0257", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要那樣說。我也想跟愛理一起吃。」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0259", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔……妳不是有哥哥在了嗎？」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0258", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥是哥哥，朋友是朋友。」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0260", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也老實地臣服在美羽學姊的魅力之下就好了說。」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0055", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣的話熊喵給愛理負責照顧，我就能獨佔美羽學姊了！」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 469, "voice": "sn0056", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳這人……」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0259", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明白了，愛理同學。總之安潔先幫妳泡茶吧？」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag0207", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安潔先把地板整理乾淨。」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0260", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學回到教室後就被大家包圍。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「仔細想想，這群人全部都有某種關聯好驚人啊，瀨名同學也是。」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 479, "voice": "ht0141", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他說的一點也沒錯。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瀨名同學！」", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什、什麼啦？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0261", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是這樣，所以妳願意的話要不要一起吃呢？」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0262", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甩頭。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是怎麼樣？不要讓我說這麼多次，我拒絕。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0263", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也豁出去主動約她，但果然瀨名同學還是不接受。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到瀨名同學的態度，我聽見結女的學生們發出竊竊私語。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──合併試辦開始至今兩個星期了。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原本對教室的氣氛有莫大影響力的瀨名同學……", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 451, "voice": "ar0264", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
